  "question": {
    "text": "In an arithmetic progression the&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow></msup></math> term is twice the <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow></msup></math> term. If its <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow></msup></math> term is <math><mi>λ</mi></math> times the <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow></msup></math> term, then <math><mi>λ</mi></math> is equal to"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>2</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
